        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Qwen-Image 2.1 image edit / multi-reference\n\n## Models (Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1)\n\n- diffusion_models: [qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors) (or qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot for lower VRAM)\n- text_encoders: [qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors) (or qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot)\n- vae: [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\nNeeds ComfyUI with native Qwen-Image 2.1 support (0.37+).\ncfg 1 = official path (negative prompt unused). Official pipeline uses 40-50 euler steps; 25 is the Comfy template default.\n\n- image 1 is the edit target; images 2-10 are optional references (the app prunes unused loaders).\n- Address them in the prompt as <image1>, <image2>, ...\n- resolution (1024) is the reference pixel budget; the output canvas follows image 1 at that budget.\n- custom canvas? switch: false = canvas from image 1 (exact edits); true = the EmptyLatentImage width/height\n  (new scenes at a chosen size; far from image 1's size, the edit can shift).\n- Output is RGB (the VAE's RGBA alpha is dropped).\n"
      ]
    }
